{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在音乐节点上的细密变化和即时感受不如X，尤其S02、S04、S10、S14，少了一些随旋律起伏逐层展开的体验。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y最明显的优势是把人物心理的因果关系讲清楚了：为什么想靠近、为什么收住、为什么害怕失去、为什么最后不再隐藏，观众不需要自行拼接大量感受词就能跟上。尤其S04、S05、S09、S11至S13，人物的心理转折和前后呼应都比X更容易理解，右侧短词也能作为辅助而不至于淹没主线。X的优势是音乐细节和感受的颗粒度，部分段落确实更有层次，但意象和感受词有时堆叠、重复，反而让观众需要花精力辨认哪些是这一刻真正重要的东西。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fd0bd619-e94b-4443-9e6b-d0e8915ebca2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T231931222664Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:20:27.604782+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "00aedf5ec4eb1333f21e5e21fafb783d2a8d1e4dd952c14ea91076882479e55d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f6